# v0.1.23 (unreleased)

## Major updates
- Added read_cellprofiler_parquet() to read the per-plate CellProfiler parquet files from the gamma version of tglow-pipeline into a TglowDataset
- Added read_pipeline_parquet() to read the per-well intensity parquet files (measure_intensity_features_with_debris) from the gamma version of tglow-pipeline into a TglowDataset
- Added default_feature_map_cellprofiler() and default_feature_map_pipeline() returning the default feature maps for these readers
- Added get_feature_meta_from_names_pipeline() to generate feature metadata for tglow-pipeline ch{N}__{stat} feature names
- Added default_meta_patterns(), default_img_meta_patterns(), default_drop_patterns() and default_img_drop_patterns() returning the default column patterns of read_cellprofiler_parquet(), with extra patterns appended
- arrow is now a dependency

## Minor changes
- Moved example parquet files to inst/extdata
- Added scale_grouped() for per-group (modified) z-scoring, fixing filter_vec_mod_z* which called the missing grouped_scale()
- Base filter_agg_* functions now accept grouping, fixing *_multicol/*_sum variants as object filters
- filter_agg_kurtosis_multicol now uses kurtosis instead of skewness
- Fixed scale_dataset() with grouping given as a column name
- Fixed the per-group LRT in calculate_lm() fitting the null model on all rows
- isAvailable() no longer reports missing columns as available when assay or assay.image is NULL
- Fixed find_outliers_pca() with return.pcs = TRUE for the default mahalanobis method, with qc.group = NULL, and with qc.group as an image column name
- Replaced filter_agg_inf_median_sum() with filter_agg_inf_median_multicol(); the _sum version always returned FALSE
- filter_vec_mod_z() now accepts a one-column matrix, fixing it as an object filter on a single feature
- Fixed grouped calculate_lm() with a single-column design (e.g. formula.null = ~1)
- LRT degrees of freedom in calculate_lm() now use the columns actually fitted, fixing groups where a term is constant and dropped
- Fixed lm_matrix() always warning that covariates.dont.use were not found
- scale_assay() and scale_dataset() now default to na.rm = TRUE, so a single NA no longer makes a whole feature NA
- PCA and UMAP rownames no longer carry a names attribute
- Fixed vingettes/example.r (apply_clustering, apply_correction_lm, find_markers, cluster column names, filter name typo)

