# v0.1.20 (unreleased)

## Major updates
- Added calculate_eigenfeatures function to calculate the first principal component for each cluster as a way to summarize the cluster's features. The variance explained by the eigenfeature is stored in the features slot of the new assay.
- Added find_eigenmarkers which calls calculate_featureclust > calculate_eigenfeatures > find_markers_ttest | find_markers_lmm on the eigen assay
- Added plot_eigenmarkers which takes a single marker test df and the eigen marker output from find_eigenmarkers



